        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5cFNUSlVWMWRXUzNwak1IUkpRMnhuVUVkek0xRRAB!2m1!1s0x34040724d3d8c4bd:0x2150760ca445c50d"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJvcTY0yQHBDQRDcVFpAx2UCE/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOa1VEUm1RV2M1U25oMk5saFRVbkpIVFRWUlZXYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "☕️ 在九龍城遇見Yoi，享受一份良い的咖啡與甜蜜\n\n他們家的門面雖不張揚，卻如寶盒般，打開後滿是驚喜🎁。事先做了些功課，發現開心果修女泡芙是人氣之選。泡芙外表已俘獲我半顆心💚，薄脆的外皮包裹著豐盈的純開心果醬。當泡芙一切開，濃郁的開心果香氣撲鼻而來，醬料細膩順滑，每一口都讓人心動不已😍。\n\n點了一杯拿鐵咖啡☕️，口感順滑，牛奶香甜，完美詮釋了一杯合格咖啡的標準。更喜歡他們用的咖啡杯，墨色陶瓷質感上乘，手感與視覺同樣令人滿足🖤。\n\n那天是星期六，店內人潮洶湧，我離開時已有兩組客人在等待座位。但我深信，這是一家值得大家細細品味的咖啡店✨。\n\nThe storefront may not be flashy, but like a treasure box, it’s full of delightful surprises when you step inside 🎁.\n\nAfter a bit of research, I found that their pistachio nun puff is the most recommended item. The puff’s appearance had already won half my heart💚. Its thin, crispy shell is filled with rich, pure pistachio cream. When you cut it open, the intense pistachio aroma fills the air, and the smooth, velvety cream makes every bite truly irresistible😍.\n\nI also ordered a latte☕️, which was smooth and creamy, perfectly capturing what a good cup of coffee should be. I especially loved their coffee cup—a dark-toned ceramic with a wonderful texture that pleases both the hand and the eye🖤.\n\nIt was a busy Saturday, and when I left, there were already two groups waiting for a table. But I truly believe this is a coffee shop worth taking the time to savor✨.",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "☕️ 在九龍城遇見Yoi，享受一份良い的咖啡與甜蜜\n\n他們家的門面雖不張揚，卻如寶盒般，打開後滿是驚喜🎁。事先做了些功課，發現開心果修女泡芙是人氣之選。泡芙外表已俘獲我半顆心💚，薄脆的外皮包裹著豐盈的純開心果醬。當泡芙一切開，濃郁的開心果香氣撲鼻而來，醬料細膩順滑，每一口都讓人心動不已😍。\n\n點了一杯拿鐵咖啡☕️，口感順滑，牛奶香甜，完美詮釋了一杯合格咖啡的標準。更喜歡他們用的咖啡杯，墨色陶瓷質感上乘，手感與視覺同樣令人滿足🖤。\n\n那天是星期六，店內人潮洶湧，我離開時已有兩組客人在等待座位。但我深信，這是一家值得大家細細品味的咖啡店✨。\n\nThe storefront may not be flashy, but like a treasure box, it’s full of delightful surprises when you step inside 🎁.\n\nAfter a bit of research, I found that their pistachio nun puff is the most recommended item. The puff’s appearance had already won half my heart💚. Its thin, crispy shell is filled with rich, pure pistachio cream. When you cut it open, the intense pistachio aroma fills the air, and the smooth, velvety cream makes every bite truly irresistible😍.\n\nI also ordered a latte☕️, which was smooth and creamy, perfectly capturing what a good cup of coffee should be. I especially loved their coffee cup—a dark-toned ceramic with a wonderful texture that pleases both the hand and the eye🖤.\n\nIt was a busy Saturday, and when I left, there were already two groups waiting for a table. But I truly believe this is a coffee shop worth taking the time to savor✨.",
